              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">During a turn in which a unit with at least one model equipped with sonic shriekers succesfully charges, or themselves is succesfully charged, all models in any enemy units locked in combat with them suffer a -1 penalty to all To Hit rolls. Models which are immune to the effects of Fear (X) are not affected.</characteristic>
